{"abstract":[{"text":"Take entities out of play without despawning them, and spawn copies of entities and templates.","type":"text"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Disabled","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Prefab"],"generated":true,"title":"Disabling Entities and Using Prefabs","anchor":"Disabling-Entities-and-Using-Prefabs"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","title":"Disabling Entities and Using Prefabs","modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"role":"article"},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/DisablingEntitiesAndUsingPrefabs"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/disablingentitiesandusingprefabs"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A game often keeps entities that shouldn’t take part in a step: an enemy waiting off screen, or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the template every goblin is copied from. A world hides those entities from queries and updates","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"while keeping their components, and it can copy any entity into a new one.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Disable an Entity","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Disable-an-Entity"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Insert "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Disabled","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" into an entity to hide it from queries and updates. The entity stays live and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps its components, and reading it through its handle still works. A query or update reaches it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"only when it reads or writes "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Disabled"},{"type":"text","text":", names it in a filter, or allows it with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".allowing(Disabled.self)"},{"type":"text","text":". Remove the mark to bring the entity back."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To make your own component types hide entities the same way, register them with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/registerDisablingComponent(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Disabling hides an entity from queries and updates only. The world’s "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/count","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/entities","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and the spans of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/withSpan(of:_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" still include it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Clone an Entity","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Clone-an-Entity"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/clone(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" spawns a new entity holding a copy of every component of another. The copies"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are new components, so they count as added and fire add and insert hooks. A clone keeps the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"original’s relations, so a clone of a child is its sibling, but the original’s children aren’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cloned."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Spawn from a Prefab","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Spawn-from-a-Prefab"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"prefab"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" is an entity marked with "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Prefab"},{"type":"text","text":" that holds a ready-made set of components. Queries"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and updates skip it, as they skip disabled entities, so the template never moves or takes damage"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"along with its copies. "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/spawn(from:)"},{"type":"text","text":" copies a prefab without its mark, so the new entity"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"takes part like any other."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Commands","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" record clones and spawns from prefabs too, so a system can spawn copies during a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"step. The following example spawns two goblins from a prefab through commands:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["var world = World()","let goblin = world.spawn(Prefab(), Name(value: \"goblin\"), Health(current: 10))","","var commands = Commands()","commands.spawn(from: goblin)","commands.spawn(from: goblin)","world.apply(commands)","","print(world.query(Name.self).count)","\/\/ Prints \"2\"","print(world.count)","\/\/ Prints \"3\""],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To keep a prefab outside any world, such as in a file, save it as a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Scene","type":"reference"},{"text":" and spawn its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entities into a world with ","type":"text"},{"code":"spawn(contentsOf:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"; see ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/SavingAndLoadingWorlds","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule"]]},"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/spawn(from:)":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"spawn","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"from","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Entity","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Entity","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/spawn(from:)","type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"spawn(from:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/spawn(from:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates an entity from a prefab, holding a copy of every component of the prefab except"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Prefab"},{"type":"text","text":" mark, and returns its handle."}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/entities":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/entities","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The live entities in the world, in slot order."}],"title":"entities","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/entities","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"entities","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EntitiesView","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule12EntitiesViewV"}],"role":"symbol"},"do